WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:03.122
Lesson ten. At school!

2
00:00:04.023 --> 00:00:10.790
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:11.782 --> 00:00:13.400
Coco, I'm going to school!

4
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.775
Hooray! Let's get ready!

5
00:00:17.175 --> 00:00:20.642
Bag! Say it with me. Bag!

6
00:00:24.642 --> 00:00:27.809
Book! Say it with me. Book!

7
00:00:31.795 --> 00:00:35.195
Chair! Say it with me. Chair!

8
00:00:39.212 --> 00:00:42.812
Crayon! Say it with me. Crayon!

9
00:00:46.831 --> 00:00:49.883
Stand up!

10
00:00:49.933 --> 00:00:53.085
Sit down!

11
00:00:53.135 --> 00:00:56.287
Stand up!

12
00:00:56.337 --> 00:00:58.208
Sit down, please!

13
00:01:01.541 --> 00:01:04.737
Open your book!

14
00:01:04.787 --> 00:01:08.170
Take a crayon!

15
00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:12.205
Draw!

16
00:01:12.255 --> 00:01:13.405
Beautiful!

17
00:01:14.375 --> 00:01:15.421
Where's my crayon?

18
00:01:15.471 --> 00:01:19.993
Where's the crayon?

19
00:01:20.043 --> 00:01:21.452
In the bag!

20
00:01:21.502 --> 00:01:22.754
Thank you, Coco!

21
00:01:23.632 --> 00:01:32.265
This is J. J is for jam. Jam! J is for jump. Jump! Jump, jump, jump!

22
00:01:36.265 --> 00:01:43.719
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

23
00:01:43.769 --> 00:01:45.334
Bye-bye, friends!

